#--- BUILD OUTPUT, NOT SOURCE.
#
# tools/ssr_package.sh rebuilds SSReplay-<build>.zip from the tree at any
# time, so committing one stores four megabytes to say what the tree
# already says. Forty-eight of them were tracked up to v79 and the habit
# was dropped when the packager landed; this is that decision written
# down, so the next build does not drift back into the repo.
SSReplay-v*.zip

#--- WORKFLOW SCRIPTS, NOT SOURCE.
#
# The Workflow tool only accepts a script path it can already read, which
# means a long-running audit harness has to be copied into the working
# tree to be resumed. The canonical copy lives in the session's own
# workflow directory and this one is a pointer, not a product file - it
# describes how an audit was orchestrated, not anything the expert does.
ssreplay-audit-resume.js
